      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "A grenade-style launcher for nether charges. The splash hurts everything near the target, so it is a crowd-clearing weapon and a poor choice at arm\u0027s reach.\n\nIt is an Assembly Line build, with the Blaster Rifle as the research item. The inputs are four Cybernetic Parts, a Hardened Steel Barrel, a Pump Mechanism, a Carbon Receiver, a LuV electric piston, two LuV circuits and HSS-G plates and screws, with soldering alloy and lubricant. Cybernetic Parts are the EV bio chain\u0027s product. NEI shows the rest.\n\n[warn]The splash can reach you. Keep your distance.[/warn]",
